From d64912e3100b6bd486a7090776d1202e75093e76 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 07:37:21 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] lane-302: MUL_MAT_ID expert gather for small-batch mat-vec
 (opt-in GGML_ARIFI_MOE_GATHER=1|2|4)

The n<=8 MUL_MAT_ID path dispatched once per token and read each routed expert once per
(token, slot) pair. The gather pipelines run one dispatch over every slot; the first-occurrence
workgroup of each expert reads it once for up to G tokens routed to it, other workgroups exit.
Per-column code is the NUM_COLS=1 id code, so a row's result does not depend on sharing.
Types: iq4_nl, iq2_s, iq3_xxs, iq3_s, iq4_xs. Default off; GGML_ARIFI_MOE_GATHER_PLANT=1 is a
test-only wrong-token-count arm.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Lane: lane-302
(cherry picked from commit 16eb17b43163cb4374be580915a126f0888044d6)

Origin: ArifiLabs (native) - fork-authored (lane-302); no upstream origin exists.
Measured-effect: part of win W17, MUL_MAT_ID slot-major expert gather at width 1: op level, real routing n4/n8: 0.73-0.94x of the old path per type (cells/cellA-10051633/); served perf split MUL_MAT_ID iq2_s 0.79, iq3_xxs 0.83, iq3_s 0.86 vs q2_0 control 0.88 (cells/cellB-10051832-read.json); served balanced ABBA x2 mean +0.34% (worst -0.69%), ids IDENT (cells/cellE-10052000-read.json, state head = 75b81abe13) [release ledger Table 1 W17]
